WEBVTT

00:13.390 --> 00:15.750
Good Morning!

00:18.450 --> 00:22.000
Would you like some rice balls for breakfast?

00:22.000 --> 00:25.380
I have Umeboshi, pickled radish, Iwanori, and cod roe fillings.

00:25.380 --> 00:27.750
Choose anything you like.

00:33.000 --> 00:35.000
You don't like any of them?!

00:35.840 --> 00:39.880
Rice balls are Japan's food culture!

02:26.040 --> 02:29.750
Damn it, why do I have to resit an exam?!

02:32.770 --> 02:39.760
Attention to the student named Hiiragi Renji who is confirmed to resit for his exam.

02:39.760 --> 02:43.020
My poor little Hiiragi Renji who is confirmed to resit for an exam,

02:43.020 --> 02:48.760
please answer the request which I am going to ask you with either "Okay" or "Yes."

02:47.520 --> 02:49.740
So Hiiragi-kun had to resit his exam...

02:49.740 --> 02:51.060
No way...

02:49.740 --> 02:51.900
That bastard Anzelotte!!

02:52.330 --> 02:56.110
Could it be that she already figured out the whereabouts of the next jewel?

02:56.110 --> 02:58.940
That's right, Elis-san.

03:00.020 --> 03:03.870
Your next destination will be an island that's not on the map.

03:03.870 --> 03:05.910
What the hell does that mean?!

03:09.350 --> 03:12.220
Today's tea is Earl Grey.

03:12.220 --> 03:14.460
The smell of the Bergamot is great don't you think?

03:15.740 --> 03:16.840
It truly is.

03:16.840 --> 03:18.130
Such a sweet smell.

03:18.130 --> 03:21.750
Ah, that's right, I brought a present for you today, Anzelotte-san.

03:22.510 --> 03:24.240
Ah, a madelene.

03:24.240 --> 03:26.000
It fits the tea perfectly.

03:26.000 --> 03:28.230
Come everyone, let's have some.

03:28.230 --> 03:29.930
Hurry up with the main event will you?!

03:30.500 --> 03:35.520
Oh no, you must not be feeling good after knowing you'll have to resit your exam, Hiiragi-san.

03:36.470 --> 03:39.160
Stop embarassing me using the school announcement speaker!

03:39.160 --> 03:41.280
Guess I can't really do anything about you, can I?

03:41.280 --> 03:44.010
Now then, let me show you your mission.

03:47.080 --> 03:52.480
There is a small island, protected by a barrier around this area of the Japan Sea.

03:52.480 --> 03:54.640
A barrier? Does that mean...

03:54.640 --> 03:57.710
Yes, the one who put up the barrier is a Wizard.

03:58.390 --> 04:02.650
He knew long ago that it holds one of the jewels.

04:02.650 --> 04:06.930
Then why didn't you go talk to him and make him hand over the jewel?

04:07.380 --> 04:11.270
That's because... it's not as easy as it seems.

04:11.800 --> 04:18.250
I have sent out a number of great Wizards before, but telling him to hand it over was never successful.

04:18.850 --> 04:23.780
Even the current Wizard whom I've sent out to negotiate with him, has yet to make any real progress.

04:24.270 --> 04:27.410
What kind of person is this Wizard?

04:27.760 --> 04:32.210
Ando Kurusu, a sword master like Hiiragi.

04:32.210 --> 04:33.520
A sword master...

04:34.250 --> 04:36.490
This is a picture of him at a younger age.

04:36.490 --> 04:40.340
He probably looks something like this nowadays.

04:40.340 --> 04:43.510
What's this? He's just an ordinary old man.

04:43.510 --> 04:45.000
This is going to be an easy job.

04:45.000 --> 04:48.640
All we have to do is put the heat on him and collect the jewel, right?

04:49.140 --> 04:53.100
Let's hurry up and finish this job, I have an exam to take!

05:05.850 --> 05:10.870
Kurusu, you have always been the rarest of Wizards.

05:11.300 --> 05:15.830
Had it not been for that incident, you'd still...

05:34.420 --> 05:37.000
So this must be what they call the "crest of a wave".

05:34.420 --> 05:41.230
<u>Note:</u> 'Nami no hana' (crest of a wave) is a flowerlike pattern on the waves in the Japan Sea during the winter.

05:37.000 --> 05:38.950
It looks like whipped cream.

05:38.950 --> 05:41.230
Quite a desolate island...

05:45.780 --> 05:46.860
Mayuri?

05:47.860 --> 05:49.380
A-Akari-san!

05:49.380 --> 05:50.530
You know her?

05:50.530 --> 05:56.720
Mayuri Bernstein, one of the Wizards who was known to save the world a long time ago.

05:56.720 --> 05:58.460
Why is a great person like her...?!

05:58.460 --> 06:05.460
Food, descending on, using tears, my venus flytrap plans, and bowing the kenes; all didn't work on him!

06:05.460 --> 06:07.250
I'm so sorry!

06:08.500 --> 06:11.750
Looks like that Ando guy is tough to break.

06:12.490 --> 06:15.940
There's no such thing, let's go and finish up this job.

06:15.940 --> 06:17.020
Okay.

06:21.600 --> 06:23.010
That must be his house.

06:23.010 --> 06:25.190
Looks tacky...

06:28.810 --> 06:30.540
Hey!

06:30.540 --> 06:31.820
You're here to challenge a dojo or something?!

06:32.320 --> 06:34.210
Maybe he is not home.

06:44.660 --> 06:49.720
Excuse me, but you must be Ando Kurusu-san, right?

06:51.470 --> 06:54.390
Another one of Anzelotte's minions?

06:56.520 --> 06:59.260
It is to protect this world!

06:59.260 --> 07:02.900
I beg you, we need the jewel no matter what!

07:05.780 --> 07:08.240
It doesn't concern me.

07:09.660 --> 07:13.150
You still call yourself a Wizard?!

07:17.690 --> 07:19.590
Hey, Hiiragi!

07:19.590 --> 07:21.620
You're a sword master too right?

07:21.620 --> 07:26.840
You won't complain if I have it my way, even if it means hurting you, right?!

07:33.550 --> 07:34.590
What?!

07:41.610 --> 07:45.960
Boy, for what purpose do you use your sword?

07:47.300 --> 07:50.320
I am asking you, why do you fight?

07:51.020 --> 07:54.700
It's because it is my duty to do so!

07:58.000 --> 08:00.500
Then you won't win against me.

08:01.270 --> 08:03.000
Never ever.

08:15.130 --> 08:18.190
Hiiragi-senpai looks down...

08:18.190 --> 08:21.520
That's because his pride was broken to pieces.

08:22.770 --> 08:25.280
Do you feel the presence of the jewel?

08:25.280 --> 08:27.010
No, nothing.

08:28.000 --> 08:30.150
This is the first time I've had this kind of thing.

08:30.720 --> 08:34.610
That's how powerful Ando Kurusu's barrier is.

08:35.640 --> 08:41.000
I give up, I wonder where he hid the jewel...

08:50.370 --> 08:51.340
Good Evening!

08:52.180 --> 08:53.590
Excuse me.

08:56.640 --> 09:01.010
I made these, please have some.

09:04.260 --> 09:09.250
If you don't find them tasty, please give them to the monkeys or the birds.

09:10.040 --> 09:11.350
I'll be on my way then.

09:34.130 --> 09:36.380
For what purpose did I fight?

09:37.010 --> 09:40.260
What other purpose is there other than it being my job?!

09:41.880 --> 09:46.220
Damn you old man!!

10:00.030 --> 10:02.370
I got you!

10:14.760 --> 10:16.170
You...

10:16.170 --> 10:18.340
Stop making a fool of me!!

10:18.760 --> 10:21.800
Ah, this feels great...

10:22.260 --> 10:24.780
Lucky for us this place has a hot spring.

10:24.780 --> 10:26.450
I feel like I'm being reborn.

10:27.770 --> 10:30.560
Elis-chan, your skin feels soft!

10:30.560 --> 10:34.140
K-Kureha-san, no, don't touch me there...

10:33.510 --> 10:34.600
Don't worry...

10:34.600 --> 10:36.400
We're both girls.

10:42.320 --> 10:45.450
It's hot! What the hell is this?!

10:47.420 --> 10:49.910
Hii-ragi...!!!

10:49.910 --> 10:52.630
Hiiragi Renji, you're the worst.

11:01.130 --> 11:03.710
Still haven't caught a single fish?!

11:03.710 --> 11:06.600
We're having a gorgeous seafood nabe for dinner, remember that!

11:06.600 --> 11:09.440
That guy is really driving me from pillar to post...

11:11.620 --> 11:13.560
Why can't I win?

11:42.840 --> 11:46.500
You must be tired, I made lunch.

11:46.500 --> 11:48.260
Would you like to have some with me?

11:52.640 --> 11:54.940
I'll eat on my own then.

12:24.550 --> 12:27.100
Do you enjoy clinging on to me?

12:27.100 --> 12:29.470
Yes, I really enjoy it!

12:38.830 --> 12:41.670
Oh no, we need to treat that wound fast!

12:41.670 --> 12:43.610
Kaguya!

12:48.120 --> 12:52.260
You have all kinds of stuff stored in your Kaguya, huh?

12:52.260 --> 12:55.350
I'm a burden to my friends.

12:55.350 --> 12:58.540
I want to be useful some of the time at least.

12:59.430 --> 13:02.050
Are your friends that important to you?

13:05.600 --> 13:12.470
I have always lived alone, without anyone near my age.

13:12.470 --> 13:19.900
But now I have Hiiragi-senpai, Kureha-san and Akari-chan with me, I too want to help them at the very least.

13:27.760 --> 13:29.490
I'm returning this to you.

13:30.240 --> 13:34.210
You ate them, I'm glad.

13:34.210 --> 13:37.270
What do you call those?

13:37.270 --> 13:41.740
It's a madelene, even Anzelotte-san was happy to have it.

13:43.780 --> 13:47.760
Do you hate Anzelotte-san?

13:47.760 --> 13:49.770
I don't like her.

13:49.770 --> 13:53.430
But you don't really hate her...

13:57.000 --> 14:01.320
Anzelotte will sacrifice everything she can in order to save the world.

14:01.320 --> 14:06.000
She will even sacrifice her friend if it's needed to complete a job.

14:06.000 --> 14:11.250
She would even order Wizards to kill each other if need be.

14:12.010 --> 14:13.990
That is who Anzelotte is.

14:19.780 --> 14:22.860
Something funny, Greate Devil Bell?

14:22.860 --> 14:26.970
I found out where Elis-chan is, and she's with someone interesting.

14:27.820 --> 14:29.470
Ando Kurusu.

14:29.470 --> 14:32.390
That's right, he was there all along.

14:33.000 --> 14:38.940
He hid the jewel by putting the whole island under a barrier, truly a great man to have as an enemy.

14:38.940 --> 14:42.610
I need someone special to go after him.

14:46.930 --> 14:50.990
I... I won't believe such a thing!

14:50.990 --> 14:56.620
Anzelotte-san would never ever order such a thing!

14:59.630 --> 15:01.260
Old man!

15:04.040 --> 15:05.630
Hiiragi-senpai...

15:05.630 --> 15:08.010
Fight me one more time!

15:08.510 --> 15:10.760
It's useless no matter how many times we fight.

15:10.760 --> 15:12.010
Shut up!

15:15.750 --> 15:18.430
If you too are a sword master, draw your sword!

15:20.600 --> 15:24.770
I know you're far superior than I am!

15:24.770 --> 15:30.780
Even if I couldn't win against you, at least fight me with your sword!

15:31.160 --> 15:32.400
I beg you!

15:41.570 --> 15:43.040
The red moon?!

15:45.750 --> 15:47.050
The clouds...

16:04.310 --> 16:07.670
What's that?! I've never seen such Emulators...!

16:07.670 --> 16:10.990
That is Fuuma, and Raima!

16:07.670 --> 16:10.990
<u>Note:</u> "Fuuma" means "Wind Demon" while "Raima" means "Thunder Demon".

16:13.580 --> 16:16.660
You must be feeling nostalgic, Ando Kurusu.

16:27.700 --> 16:30.050
Elis, run away!

16:35.590 --> 16:36.760
Hiiragi-senpai!

16:46.150 --> 16:47.480
Akari-chan!

16:49.260 --> 16:50.520
Kureha-san!

16:50.520 --> 16:51.860
Sorry to keep you waiting!

16:54.180 --> 16:55.410
BOWTEX!!

17:00.730 --> 17:03.010
Damn it, I'm not going to let you have it your way!

17:03.010 --> 17:06.210
Stop it, you can't win against those two right now.

17:06.680 --> 17:09.740
You're going to throw your life away for such a useless mission?!

17:09.740 --> 17:11.670
It's not for the mission...

17:11.670 --> 17:14.830
They are here for Elis's life.

17:14.830 --> 17:17.180
We're the one who'll protect her from them!

17:18.180 --> 17:22.140
That's right, Elis-chan is one of us!

17:25.270 --> 17:28.690
We won't back away if it's to protect one of our own!

17:29.090 --> 17:33.650
There's no way we can protect the world if we can't even protect one of our own!

17:33.650 --> 17:38.040
I'll save both my friends and the world!

17:39.760 --> 17:44.550
Please take Elis to a safer place!

17:44.550 --> 17:47.080
We will hold them off!

17:50.550 --> 17:51.820
Ando-san...

17:51.820 --> 17:53.000
Come with me...

17:53.000 --> 17:55.280
Where to?

17:55.280 --> 17:58.890
To the place where my old friends are sleeping.

18:11.160 --> 18:13.320
This is behind the waterfall?

18:21.110 --> 18:22.380
Ando-san...

18:22.380 --> 18:26.160
I lost my friends in exchange for the jewel.

18:27.270 --> 18:30.630
It happened during a mission Anzelotte gave us.

18:39.740 --> 18:43.110
Ando, we've received orders to fall back, tell the others!!

18:43.110 --> 18:47.600
Did you hear that, Yuu! Fall back! Retreat!

18:50.020 --> 18:53.020
You go on ahead, protect the jewel!

18:55.070 --> 18:56.270
Yuu!!

18:57.360 --> 18:59.320
Wait, Yuu is still out there!

18:59.320 --> 19:01.280
Are you throwing away your own friends?!

19:01.720 --> 19:04.850
We must put protecting the jewel as our top priority.

19:04.850 --> 19:06.600
Transport him back.

19:06.600 --> 19:07.450
Sir!

19:08.380 --> 19:09.410
Yuu!!

19:09.410 --> 19:13.250
Kurusu, you must give the Jewel of Trust to Anzelotte!

19:13.250 --> 19:15.040
Yuu!!

19:24.010 --> 19:30.640
The decision Anzelotte made that day was right from the perception of a protector of the world.

19:31.530 --> 19:39.990
The only thing she didn't take into consideration was the refusal at the very last moment by one of the Wizards who survived.

19:40.590 --> 19:44.010
Thank you for your job on taking the jewel back.

19:44.010 --> 19:47.830
Kurusu, hand over the Jewel of Trust.

19:49.740 --> 19:51.160
What's wrong?

19:51.160 --> 19:52.790
Hurry up and hand it over.

19:53.620 --> 19:57.010
Kurusu, Kurusu!

19:59.960 --> 20:06.230
I couldn't forgive Anzelotte for leaving Yuu to die in order to save the world.

20:06.850 --> 20:14.650
But what I truly couldn't forgive was maybe the fact that I didn't have the power to even save one of my friends.

20:15.570 --> 20:23.360
That idiot told me, he'd protect the world and his friends.

20:29.000 --> 20:36.290
Hiiragi! Show me that power of yours that could protect the world and your friends!

20:38.670 --> 20:40.030
Hiiragi!

21:17.760 --> 21:18.960
You saved me.

21:20.250 --> 21:26.930
Ando-san, will you let me have the jewel that Yuu-san gave to you?

21:27.520 --> 21:32.100
I think that Yuu-san too wished for the same thing.

21:49.620 --> 21:51.000
The barrier...

21:51.000 --> 21:51.870
is gone.

21:53.550 --> 21:59.250
Yuu-san, please let me have the jewel.

22:19.010 --> 22:22.980
I have received the Jewel of Trust.

22:25.020 --> 22:26.490
Is that so?

22:26.490 --> 22:28.450
This makes it the fourth jewel then.

22:29.410 --> 22:33.410
All that's left is the Jewel of Justice, Temperance and Hope.

22:34.650 --> 22:37.870
What about the report on Ando Kurusu?

22:37.870 --> 22:41.290
Sir, going very strong, I hear.

22:42.500 --> 22:43.590
I see.

22:47.480 --> 22:51.260
Ando-san, come to Anzelotte's place with us.

22:52.250 --> 22:57.000
It's depressing to think I'll let her use me when I'm already this old.

22:58.370 --> 23:00.390
You said the same thing Hiiragi did.

23:02.290 --> 23:07.490
Ando-san, once this mission is done, let's have another round.

23:08.000 --> 23:09.570
Fine with me.

24:50.920 --> 24:55.000
Oji-sama, I'm already at my limit.

24:55.000 --> 24:58.180
I can't help feeling sleepy.

24:59.720 --> 25:01.430
Good night...

25:03.060 --> 25:05.440
Don't sleep while the camera is rolling, Elis!

25:06.100 --> 25:11.610
Next time on Night Wizard THE ANIMATION, Nightmare, Elis Unconscious.

25:13.070 --> 25:14.400
Wake up, Elis!
